ponent(parts[0], text)\n        return (n, n)\n    if len(parts) == 2:\n        start = _parse_component(parts[0], text)\n        stop = _parse_component(parts[1], text)\n        if start > stop:\n            raise ValueError(\"window start %d exceeds stop %d\" % (start, stop))\n        return (start, stop)\n    raise ValueError(\"window specification has too many ':' separators: %r\" % (text,))\n```\n\n- **`test_window.py`** — new, window-specific regression tests, including the phase-2 cases: `test_boolean_rejected` (`True`/`False`, checked before the `str` test because `bool` is an `int` subclass and would otherwise slip through), `test_non_string_rejected` (`5`, `2.5`, `None`, tuple, list, `object()`), `test_invalid_strings` (`'5:2'`, `'-1'`, `'1:2:3'`, `'x'`, `''`, `'   '`, `':'`, `'1:'`, `':2'`, `'1.5'`, `'+5'`, `'1 : 2'`), `test_non_ascii_digits_rejected` (Arabic-Indic `٥`).\n- **`test_ops.py`** — untouched, as required.\n\n### Test evidence\n\nCommand: `python -m unittest -v` (from the working directory), exit code 0:\n\n```\ntest_invalid (test_ops.Checks) ... ok\ntest_label (test_ops.Checks) ... ok\ntest_window (test_ops.Checks) ... ok\ntest_boolean_rejected (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_invalid_strings (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_non_ascii_digits_rejected (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_non_string_rejected (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_outer_whitespace_is_trimmed (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_range_value (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_returns_plain_ints (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\ntest_single_value (test_window.ParseWindowTests) ... ok\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 11 tests in 0.001s\n\nOK\n```\n\nAll 11 tests pass, including the pre-existing `test_ops.py` checks.\n\n### Unfinished work\n\n- **The native delegation/continuation exercise itself is unfinished and cannot be finished from here.** No background child was e